  "title": "Cheapest Flights Within K Stops",
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "Find the cheapest route from source to destination using at most k intermediate stops.",
  "problem": "Given directed flights with prices, find the cheapest cost from src to dst using at most k stops. A stop is an intermediate node along the route. If no such route exists, return -1.",
  "example": {
    "input": "n=4, flights=[[0,1,100],[1,2,100],[2,3,100],[0,2,500]], src=0, dst=3, k=1",
    "output": "600"
  },
  "steps": [
